elect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x = 2$ is a root of even multiplicity.\n- **II.** $x = ± 1$ are roots of odd multiplicity.\n- **III.** $p(0) = 2$." :question/worked-solution "At x=2 the curve touches and turns at the x-axis (even multiplicity). At x=-1 and x=1 it crosses (odd multiplicity). The y-intercept is below zero, so p(0)=2 is false."} {:db/id 17592186129699 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a81dde9d-7e4f-5cbc-8930-a85852a7afde" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186439673} {:answer/id #uuid "0c6f74a9-acf9-5646-99cd-d6e0ac1753f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186439674}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a81dde9d-7e4f-5cbc-8930-a85852a7afde" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186439673} :answer-field/id #uuid "0d8ef24e-31f2-5b16-95f7-e3e770bb7d8c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186440194} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "918b0fa1-0b23-583e-a035-9d581dbf8a7c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186439675} {:answer/id #uuid "e7d545d0-bed3-5bd7-a2fd-c2acbbd879d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186439676}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e7d545d0-bed3-5bd7-a2fd-c2acbbd879d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186439676} :answer-field/id #uuid "b071ece6-e900-5d85-bc7b-7f36900454c4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186440195} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b43dce15-5b2f-531a-abf1-41aca7caf09e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186439677} {:answer/id #uuid "c87e382c-4656-5a0a-875d-64acf4452ebd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 1759218643967